# ── backend/sql_agent (consolidated, self-contained SQL agent) ───────────────
# Runtime code (backend/sql_agent/src/, the shim files, __init__.py) is
# tracked as ordinary source — no ignore rule needed for it.
#
# backend/sql_agent/embeddings/ holds the PREBUILT runtime artifacts (FAISS
# indexes, schema.json, concept_map.json, qa_pairs.json, semantic_layer.yaml,
# business_dictionary.yaml, bm25_table_index.pkl, ...) this package reads at
# request time. There is no build step in this repo, so these ARE tracked and
# shipped — do NOT ignore *.faiss / *.pkl / *.json / *.yaml under this path.
# A refreshed embeddings drop replaces this folder's contents wholesale; it is
# never rebuilt in-repo.
#
# Everything that BUILDS those artifacts (schema/DDL extraction, index
# construction, QA-pair authoring, evaluation) lives only in the separate
# development repo and must never be copied in here. These rules are a
# defensive net, not the primary control — the primary control is simply
# never copying that code into this repo:
**/embedding_building/
backend/sql_agent/eval/
backend/sql_agent/scripts/

# The old top-level vendored checkout this migration replaces. Guards against
# it reappearing via a stray clone/copy.
/sql_agent/

# Temporary rollback copies made during the consolidation migration — never
# commit these; delete once the migration is validated.
**/_sql_agent.bak/

# ── db_qa intent-exemplar embedding index (generated — rebuild via
#    `python -m backend.db_qa.intents.embedding_index`) ───────────────────────
backend/db_qa/intents/output/*.faiss
backend/db_qa/intents/output/*.pkl

# ── Temporary audio files (recorded by speech input) ─────────────────────────
*.wav

# ── Local databases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.db
*.sqlite

# ── Sentence-transformer model cache ──────────────────────────────────────────
sentence_transformers_cache/
